message.content:
Here’s an example of how you could call the API for Apple’s annual income statements (replace `YOUR_API_KEY` with your actual key):

```json
{
  "url": "https://financialmodelingprep.com/api/v3/income-statement/AAPL",
  "params": {
    "period": "annual",
    "datatype": "json",
    "limit": 10
  },
  "apikey": "YOUR_API_KEY"
}
```

This request will return the most recent 10 annual reports for Apple in JSON format. Adjust the `symbol`, `period`, `datatype`, or `limit` fields as needed for other companies or data preferences.

